place Note_Paper dnote at 16.9 36.6 ground y=1.6 drop yaw=20
note dnote Lost traveller's note | I came for the seeds like everyone else. Three weeks rowing, one bad tooth, a sunburn shaped like a hat.\n\nThe paths move. I am sure of it. I marked this tree twice, and the second mark is higher up the trunk than the first, as if the tree grew a hand's width in a night.\n\nA Seedkeeper with a kind face gave me tea and asked where I had come from, and whether anyone knew I was here. I said no. He seemed pleased about that, and then sorry he was pleased.\n\nIf the fire is cold, I went towards the sea. If the fire is warm, I am behind you. Say hello.
place Caravan_Yellow_01 dvan at -7.4 38.3 ground yaw=57
prop dvan tint.color=#7a7040
prop dvan tint.amount=0.5
place Loot_ChestSmall dwreckchest at -11.4 41.3 ground sit yaw=357
note dwreckchest Abandoned supplies | The crew's supplies, left behind: plank, rope and a few seeds.
