# --- DEEP 10-24 (one-hour pass: a climb, a dive, more to find; RAFT_ISLAND_DESIGN 0b): Owl Hill and its fire lookout (climb, zipline down), the seed caravan in the bay (dive), the mother boar's den and the feeding trough (M5)
# Owl Hill (STORY 10-24: no tower or zipline here any more - an optional hill walk to the burnt-out fire watch, its
# box, Burr's bell and the old campfire; no quest step)
call vd_mount x=-58 z=40 top=22 r=24 a0=300 turns=1.25 hb=3
place Loot_ChestSmall hgbox at -57 40.8 h=22 sit yaw=200
