note hgbox Fire lookout box | SEEDKEEPERS - FIRE WATCH. Smoke over the trunks: ring the greenhouse bell. Smoke over the bay: that is the caravan people cooking again.
loot hgbox Rope*3;Plank*4;Leather*1
prop hgbox loot.refill=0
# the dive: Caravan_Yellow_01 on the sea floor 11 m down, its crate, an air pocket
