note hgcrate Seed caravan's locker | Rows of waxed jars, most cracked. One is whole: the oldest seeds of the grove, labelled in three hands.\n\nFIRST SEEDS - grove, year one. - Aki\nDO NOT OPEN IN THE LAB. - Marit\nBEFORE V-1. KEEP THESE CLEAN, WHATEVER HAPPENS. - T.L.
loot hgcrate story:seedjar*1;Scrap*3;Bolt*2
# the mother boar (RAFT_QUEST_MECHANICS SL11 3, M5): she sleeps across the mouth of her den in the hollow stump; the
# trough by the path takes five red berries and she goes to it - or the player fights her.
# M38 lure (10-24): the berries open the trough and her spawn's home moves to it (beh.lure); her den is left free.
