# --- STORY 10-24: Jonas's bee notes by the bee box, the greenhouse log, Oda's note on Owl Hill
place Note_Paper jonasbees at 35.6 -11.2 ground y=0.3 drop
note jonasbees Bee notes | BEES - JONAS BRANDT\n\nHive 1: happy. Hive 2: happy. Hive 3: has opinions.\n\nThe honey this month is the colour of lamp oil and so sweet it makes your teeth ring. The bees fly to the trunks, then down to the root hole, then come back slow, like they have had a big lunch.\n\nTeodor took six jars to the lab. He was very kind about it. He said, "Jonas, your bees are the best measure I have." I said thank you. I did not ask of what.\n\nThe bees will not go past the dark root at the hole any more. They circle it and come home.\n\nI trust bees more than people. Bees do not make speeches.
place Note_Paper greenlog at 1.6 -41.4 ground y=0.3 drop
note greenlog Greenhouse log | GREENHOUSE LOG - SEEDKEEPERS\n\nWeek 1: beans up. Week 2: beans up to the roof. Week 3: beans through the roof. Lise says the roof was a suggestion.\n\nTeodor came down from the Heart with a sprayer. "Just a little V-1 on the beds, to keep the mould away." The mould went away. So did the slugs, the beetles and the frogs. Nothing hops in here now.\n\nThe tomatoes taste wonderful. I want to be clear about that, whatever happens next. They taste wonderful.\n\nThe crew is going down the root hole to look for the river people. Lise is taking the lamps. I am taking the sandwiches.\n\n- G.
place Note_Paper burrbell at -57.6 38.8 h=22.1 drop
note burrbell Note on the fire ring | O.F. - OWL HILL\n\nSat up here to look for lamps. Saw none. Heard a bell instead, all night, going round and round the hill. Burr, following me up in the dark like a very small, very bad guard.\n\nI used to bring Marit up here when she was little. She counted the owls carved on the stones and always got a different number. Twenty-two. Twenty-six. "Owls move, Oda."\n\nThere are twenty-four. I counted three times. I will tell her when I find her and she will say they moved.

# --- Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest ----------------------------------------------------------------
info title=Hollowtrunk Grove
info author=Custom Islands
info description=Five giant trees with huts at their feet, the Seedkeepers' greenhouse and a zipline between the trunks - and a hole between the biggest tree's roots. The fifth island of The Last Green World.
island on.arrive=message||Trees as tall as towers. Under the biggest one, the ground falls away into the dark between its roots.

note rota Seedkeeper's watering rota | WATERING ROTA - SEEDKEEPERS\n\nTank first, then the trunks, in order.\nTrunk 2: ride the line to trunk 4. Pipes and the purifier are on the deck.\n\nPump parts: one in each trunk - 3 with the bees, 4 in the store, 5 under the vines.\nSeed store at the big tree. Keep the drawers locked.\n\nNO ONE goes into the roots. - M.
note rangerlog6 Ranger log 6 | RANGER LOG 6 - O. FENN\n\nThe greenhouse is dry. The seed drawers are full, every packet labelled - they meant to come back. Seedkeepers do not leave seeds behind. That is the whole job; it is in the name.\n\nTheir lamps went down between the roots of the big tree. The ground there breathes: warm air, and a smell like fruit left in a hot room.\n\nBurr will not go near it. He stood at the edge and rang his bell at me until I threw a pine cone at him. He did not take it personally. He ate it.\n\nUnder the grove the roots go on - Rootweave, the Seedkeepers call it, caves of root and stone all the way to the Heart. Aki ran their root gate down there. The band is 600.\n\nI am going down. I have the vial, the lamp and a goat. That is more than most expeditions.
note watertower Water tower tank | The water tower's tank: the tank's own plans in a tin, wrapped in oilcloth.
note trunkstore Trunk store | Trunk 4's store box: plans for water pipes, a coil of rope.
note crownbox Crown box | The crown box on trunk 4's deck: the plans of a purifier that runs on power.
note seedstore Seed store | The seed store's big chest: its own plans, for a store like it.
note seeddrawers Seed drawers | The seed drawers: pineapple, mango and a black flower's seeds, each in a labelled paper.
loot watertower Blueprint_WaterTank*1;Plank*4;Nail*6
prop watertower loot.refill=0
loot trunkstore Blueprint_Pipe_Water*1;Rope*2;story:pumppart*1
prop trunkstore loot.refill=0
loot crownbox Blueprint_ElectricPurifier*1;CopperIngot*1
prop crownbox loot.refill=0
loot seedstore Blueprint_Storage_Large*1;Plank*6
prop seedstore loot.refill=0
prop seedstore obj.name=seedstore
prop seedstore beh.hidden=1
story pumppart|Pump part|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|A part of the water tower's pump: a valve, a gasket, a crank rod.
story water|Water running|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The water tower's pump runs; water reaches the greenhouse and the roots.
note beebox Beekeepers' box | The Seedkeepers' bee box, wedged in trunk 3's roots: smoker, comb and a pump valve.
# (box agent 10-25: a spare machete here - the vines need one, and a fresh world or a lost one from the delta left the island stuck)
loot beebox story:pumppart*1;HoneyComb*2;Machete*1
prop beebox loot.refill=0
note trunk5chest Trunk 5 chest | A chest the vines grew over at trunk 5's foot: a gasket in oilcloth, and seeds.
loot trunk5chest story:pumppart*1;Seed_Flower_Red*2
prop trunk5chest loot.refill=0
prop trunk5chest obj.name=trunk5chest
prop trunk5chest beh.hidden=1
prop trunk5vines obj.name=trunk5vines
prop trunk5vines on.use=hide|\nshow|trunk5chest\nmessage||The machete clears trunk 5's foot. A chest under the vines.
prop towerpump obj.name=towerpump
prop towerpump beh.use=Fit the parts to the pump
prop towerpump if.use=take|story:pumppart|3
prop towerpump on.use=message||Valve, gasket, rod. The pump thumps; water runs down the pipes to the greenhouse and gurgles away into the roots of trunk 1. The seed store's lock was on the water: it opens.\ngive||story:water*1\nshow|seedstore\nshow|rootszone
prop towerpump else.use=message||The water tower's pump is stripped. The rota says: "Pump parts kept in the trunks - 3, 4 and 5."
note rangercache Ranger locker | Oda's locker at trunk 1: a lantern, rope and honey.
loot rangercache Placeable_Lantern_Metal*1;Rope*3;HoneyComb*2
prop rangercache loot.refill=0
prop rangercache obj.name=rangercache
prop rangercache beh.hidden=1
prop rangerlock obj.name=rangerlock
prop rangerlock beh.use=Open the ranger locker
prop rangerlock if.use=has|story:rangerkey
prop rangerlock on.use=hide|\nshow|rangercache\nmessage||Oda's key fits. Her locker opens.
prop rangerlock else.use=message||A locker stencilled RANGER. A ranger's key would open it.
loot seeddrawers Seed_Pineapple*2;Seed_Mango*2;Seed_Flower_Black*1
prop seeddrawers loot.refill=0
prop burrvines on.use=hide|\nshow|burrchest\nmessage||Burr pushes in as the vines fall - he found it: a cache in the roots.

prop greenhousezone zone.id=greenhouse
prop greenhousezone zone.radius=6
prop greenhousezone zone.message=The Seedkeepers' greenhouse. Dry beds, a water tower, an old token machine.
prop trunk4zone zone.id=trunk_4
