prop rootszone zone.message=The root hole. Warm air breathes up out of the dark.

# DEEP 10-24 settings
story seedjar|Old seed jar|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The grove's oldest seeds, from the sunk seed caravan.
story denkey|Seedkeeper's key|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|A seedkeeper's key on a leather loop, from the mother boar's den.
