prop trough on.use=signal||fed\nmessage||The berries thud into the trough. Somewhere a big sow grunts, gets up and comes trotting - past you, to the food.
prop trough else.use=message||A feeding trough, licked clean. The seedkeepers kept the old sow sweet with berries: five, the board said.
prop hgmother obj.name=hgmother
quest title=The Hollow Trees
quest intro=Trees as tall as towers. Make for the tall trunks, then find the Seedkeepers' greenhouse on the beach.
step reach|greenhouse|1|Go to the Seedkeepers' greenhouse
step read|Seedkeeper's watering rota|1|Read the watering rota
step blueprint|Blueprint_WaterTank|1|Take the water tank plans from the water tower
step reach|trunk_4|1|Ride the zipline from trunk 2 to trunk 4
step blueprint|Blueprint_Pipe_Water|1|Take the water pipe plans from trunk 4's store
step blueprint|Blueprint_ElectricPurifier|1|Take the purifier plans from the crown box
step collect|story:pumppart|3|Find the pump's three parts in trunks 3, 4 and 5
step collect|story:water|1|Fit the parts to the water tower's pump
step blueprint|Blueprint_Storage_Large|1|Take the large storage plans from the seed store
step open|Seed drawers|1|Open the seed drawers
step collect|story:seedjar|1|Dive to the sunk seed caravan in the bay and take the seed jar
step collect|story:denkey|1|Get the key from the mother boar's den (fill her trough with five berries, or fight her)
step read|Ranger log 6|1|Read Ranger log 6 in the seed store
step reach|roots|1|Go down into the root hole
quest done=Under the grove, the roots go on. Rootweave - band 600.
quest reward=HoneyComb*2;Seed_Birch*2

